{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "099874c35f654d8768666db9a3f4a7968bdafd1b9aae2686349660465514f60a", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# ASM-07 — Multi-Concept Question Patterns"}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "7a1023a5b96747e68e408f53f999b8471df84105657805d7cd96aea5cc6ad7a1", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact analyses how the 4CH1 papers combine multiple concepts inside single\nquestions, as parsed in the official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): shared\nstimulus boxes, cross-part consequential marking, investigation chains that blend\ntechnique with explanation, and questions whose parts span specification topics. It\nextends the archetype view (ASM-03) with the papers' integration machinery. Every\nclaim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed excerpt from the run's evidence\npack. Research artifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "1ea5d1067d1f70ae68d2c85bf48f3f59696516cd93d434f5cb3b6bbd580eb49e", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** shared-stimulus boxes; cross-part mark dependencies (CSQ chains);\ninvestigation chains; topic-spanning question designs.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C and 2CR papers of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** single-concept archetype anatomy (ASM-03), tariff statistics\n(ASM-05), examiner commentary (EXM family)."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "c20ce2f9531a7f3e86e0f0c0f1c24b7a79a1f88a70055da436b71a5fbd5e0490", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe papers integrate concepts through four observable devices. A stimulus box (a list\nof gases, a table of metals) feeds several parts that each probe a different concept.\nConsequential marking (CSQ) chains a part's marks onto an earlier answer, so an early\nerror propagates — visibly, by design. Extended investigations weave technique,\nobservation and explanation into one mark tariff. And question-level designs walk a\nconcept ladder — from identification to property to mechanism — inside a single\nquestion stem. For revision design the implication is direct: isolated fact drills\nunder-prepare; concept-connection practice is what the papers actually test."}
