{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "e456584da4a957cebf6f9f5ffd1b2f84d2b4d8a17dccaadddf19f0652a21b32a", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C and 2CR official extractions\n(bounded line-window excerpts with line locators preserved, embedded mark-scheme text\ncited verbatim). No ER evidence consumed (EXM ground); no specimen material cited;\nsupplementary sources not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "chunk_id": "ASM-07:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "5a871e01ef9b047e1c10d3f02eb7d570b94063498f7e799c41461dddb489bfcb", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-07", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nIntegration patterns are observed on two paper files of the pack; the inventory is a\nfloor, not a census. The CSQ chain on the precipitate part is quoted from its parsed\nguidance window, whose trailing text is truncated in the excerpt (\"Mark CSQ on (a)\nand\" — the full continuation sits outside the excerpt window and is not quoted).\nQuantitative integration statistics belong to ASM-05/ASM-09 ground. No canonical\nplanes were written."}
